29	// reading any other one is reading something nobody sets, which is silent and
30	// permanent (a `CLAUDINITE_OVERRIDES` left over from the slot scheduler read as an
31	// empty bag, so a fleet sweep's REPOS filter and DRY_RUN switch were inert and
